{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25945","headline":"姑苏宫行 · 鲍溶","name":"姑苏宫行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"姑苏宫，九层金台半虚空。\n雕楹璇题鬬皎洁，中有妖姬似明月。\n西见洞庭秋镜开，水华百里盘宫来。\n越王采女能水戏，仙舟如龙旌曳翠。\n羽盖晴翻橘柚香，玉笙夜送芙蓉醉。\n归帆平静君无劳，还从下下上高高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}